to-be-incorporated-into-paper-lines-88 : List (List Word)
to-be-incorporated-into-paper-lines-88 = cons "" (cons "`(%view v)` turns the outermost form of a computed value into an ordinary data constructor in one" (cons "step, whose fields are the value's own parts: a Π type gives `(wpi A B)` with `A` the domain and" (cons "`B` the codomain as a function, a stuck application gives `(wapp f a T)`. A program cases on this" (cons "like any data, so a program in the language can examine a value's structure. What it sees is the" (cons "computed value, not the source text that produced it; a function shows only as `(wlam f)`." (cons "`(%var T)` and `(%dim)` make fresh variables, `(%dnf r)` gives an interval's or a face's clauses" (cons "as lists of literals, and `(%motive f)` an elimination's motive. The type checker (`lib/check.cub`) is written with" (cons "these and runs on this runtime, over the values the runtime already computed for each subterm:" (cons "there is no second evaluator, and checking a definition is running that program on it." nil)))))))))
